    {
      "number": "14",
      "text": "14. \u628a\u4e0b\u5217\u591a\u9879\u5f0f\u5199\u6210\u4e24\u4e2a\u4e00\u6b21\u5f0f\u7684\u79ef\uff1a\na) $0.1x^2-10x+240$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{1}{16}y^2-\\frac{3}{8}y-1$\uff1b\nc) $0.3x^2+2.5x-55$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "15",
      "text": "15. \u7ea6\u5206\uff0c\u5e76\u4fdd\u7559\u539f\u5206\u6bcd\u4e0d\u4e3a\u96f6\u7684\u9650\u5236\uff1a\na) $\\frac{7x^2+x-8}{7x-7}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{5a+10}{2a^2+13a+18}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{b^2-8b+15}{b^2-25}$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{y^2-5y-36}{81-y^2}$\uff1b\ne) $\\frac{c^2-c-110}{22+9c-c^2}$\uff1b\nf) $\\frac{5a^2+8a+3}{14+3a-11a^2}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "16",
      "text": "16. \u4f5c\u51fa\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff0c\u4fdd\u7559\u539f\u5206\u5f0f\u7684\u5b9a\u4e49\u57df\uff1a\na) $y=\\frac{x^2-5x+6}{x-2}$\uff1b\nb) $y=\\frac{-2x^2+7x-3}{2x-1}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "17",
      "text": "17. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\uff1a\na) $3a^2-10a-8<0$\uff1b\nb) $y^2-26y+168<0$\uff1b\nc) $x^2+6x-55>0$\uff1b\nd) $-2b^2+9b+5>0$.",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "18",
      "text": "18. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u4e0d\u7b49\u5f0f\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}4x-21>0,\\\\x+3.5<0\\end{cases}$\uff1b\nb) $\\begin{cases}5x-9\\leqslant0,\\\\2x+7\\leqslant0\\end{cases}$\uff1b\nc) $\\begin{cases}5-4x<10,\\\\1-3x<-2\\end{cases}$\uff1b\nd) $\\begin{cases}3x-6>5,\\\\1-4x>8\\end{cases}$.",
      "figure_ids": []
